//! task: fix
//! ask: Return a u8 as a u32.
//! expect: EXS-E0303
//! refs: §5.4, §8.6
//! explain: Exsecutor has no implicit widening: a `u8` is not a `u32`. The conversion is the explicit cast `sicut u32`, so that every width change is visible in the source.

publica functio amplia(a: u8) -> u32 {
    redde a;
}
//@ fixed
publica functio amplia(a: u8) -> u32 {
    redde a sicut u32;
}
